WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:05.400 --> 00:06.401
[This drama is intended for entertainment purposes only.]

4
00:06.411 --> 00:08.400
[All characters, behaviors, locations, and events depicted are fictional.]

5
00:08.430 --> 00:09.950
[It is not intended to be sexually suggestive or to encourage viewers]

6
00:10.000 --> 00:11.501
[to engage in inappropriate or morally objectionable behavior.]

7
00:11.511 --> 00:12.890
[Nor is it intended to discredit any profession]

8
00:12.899 --> 00:13.900
[or create negative perceptions of any organization]

9
00:13.911 --> 00:14.912
[or any particular group of people.]

10
00:15.030 --> 00:19.031
Mutta Jongsawat, she has a history of unprotected sex.

11
00:19.083 --> 00:22.680
She's been diagnosed with gonorrhea.

12
00:24.142 --> 00:25.400
Mutta has this disease?

13
00:25.443 --> 00:27.880
Don't ever abuse your authority to hurt Mutta again.

14
00:27.955 --> 00:30.360
- Should I be scared? - I'll announce to the media

15
00:30.430 --> 00:31.960
that you and I

16
00:32.131 --> 00:34.760
are no longer husband and wife.

17
00:34.856 --> 00:36.000
Are you starting to get scared?

18
00:36.504 --> 00:37.520
The test results are in.

19
00:38.120 --> 00:41.421
Syphilis, gonorrhea, HPV, and HIV. All negative.

20
00:41.795 --> 00:44.320
Whoever's trying to frame me like this, stop it.

21
00:44.680 --> 00:45.681
It's pathetic.

22
00:45.720 --> 00:46.721
- We know! - We know!

23
00:46.741 --> 00:48.960
Does she seriously not care that she's been exposed for having gonorrhea?

24
00:49.048 --> 00:51.208
That's right. Her results came back negative,

25
00:51.249 --> 00:53.600
and nobody's gossiping about it anymore.

26
00:53.886 --> 00:56.680
She seems awfully proud of the ring Phop gave her,

27
00:56.771 --> 00:59.072
when there should only be one ring.

28
00:59.082 --> 01:01.790
Then let's use that ring to hurt her.

29
01:01.843 --> 01:03.600
- Police? - Hello.

30
01:03.955 --> 01:05.606
You're Mutta Jongsawat, correct?

31
01:05.672 --> 01:07.720
May I see both your hands, please?

32
01:07.733 --> 01:09.760
You've been accused of stealing this ring.

33
01:09.923 --> 01:11.200
Please come with us to the police station.

34
01:11.358 --> 01:12.960
Hong, aren't they two different rings?

35
01:12.990 --> 01:15.840
Then would you dare testify for Ta, Whiskey?

36
01:49.872 --> 01:50.873
Huh?

37
01:52.358 --> 01:53.359
Where are you going, Ta?

38
01:55.899 --> 01:56.900
Oh.

39
01:58.027 --> 01:59.947
You want to do it on the balcony, huh?

40
02:00.491 --> 02:01.492
Sure, let's go.

41
02:04.092 --> 02:05.360
That's not it, Director.

42
02:09.211 --> 02:10.880
I think we should end things here.

43
02:12.975 --> 02:14.560
I can't take this anymore.

44
02:15.056 --> 02:16.057
Huh?

45
02:18.262 --> 02:19.320
Did I hurt you, Ta?

46
02:21.728 --> 02:22.760
I'm sorry.

47
02:23.624 --> 02:24.625
Then...

48
02:24.880 --> 02:26.160
I'll be gentler this time.

49
02:27.920 --> 02:28.921
No, that's not it.

50
02:33.854 --> 02:36.200
I can't live with this guilt anymore.

51
02:41.534 --> 02:43.760
I don't want to be known as anyone's mistress.

52
02:46.392 --> 02:48.560
Let's stop seeing each other outside of work.

53
02:50.851 --> 02:51.852
Oh, come on.

54
02:53.803 --> 02:54.804
Ta.

55
02:55.206 --> 02:58.448
In just a few years, my kids will all be grown up.

56
02:59.136 --> 03:02.400
When that day comes, I'll pack my things and move in here with you.

57
03:04.336 --> 03:05.337
Please wait for me.

58
03:05.700 --> 03:06.701
Please.

59
03:08.512 --> 03:10.213
Then why don't we wait until that day comes

60
03:10.912 --> 03:12.520
before we see each other again?

61
03:15.760 --> 03:17.840
I can't wait that long, Ta.

62
03:18.651 --> 03:20.400
Can you really bear to wait?

63
03:21.700 --> 03:23.720
Then I'll resign.

64
03:27.323 --> 03:29.184
Maybe if we stop seeing each other,

65
03:30.486 --> 03:32.360
we'll stop missing each other so much.

66
03:34.283 --> 03:36.480
Or if you don't truly love me,

67
03:38.688 --> 03:41.089
we can finally cut ties for good.

68
03:42.187 --> 03:43.188
Ta.

69
04:09.158 --> 04:11.136
I've been looking for the right moment to surprise you.

70
04:17.390 --> 04:18.391
Ta.

71
04:35.536 --> 04:37.640
Please stop doubting my love for you.

72
04:46.371 --> 04:47.960
I'll wait for you, Director.

73
04:53.134 --> 04:54.135
This ring...

74
04:56.507 --> 04:58.360
Don't wear it outside where anyone can see it.

75
05:00.200 --> 05:01.280
Especially my wife.

76
05:14.790 --> 05:18.191
He told me never to wear the ring outside.

77
05:19.104 --> 05:20.840
But I wore it just once,

78
05:21.536 --> 05:22.960
and his wife saw it.

79
05:23.787 --> 05:25.000
She was furious.

80
05:25.824 --> 05:27.720
She slapped me so hard I tumbled down the stairs.

81
05:28.443 --> 05:31.104
Everyone just stood there watching like it was a circus.

82
05:32.534 --> 05:34.400
She ordered everyone to keep their mouths shut

83
05:35.115 --> 05:37.250
and had all the security footage erased.

84
05:38.352 --> 05:40.080
I'm just a tiny little ant

85
05:40.774 --> 05:42.840
being crushed by an elephant.

86
05:43.995 --> 05:47.160
She has the power to summon every beast in the jungle

87
05:47.432 --> 05:49.250
to attack me whenever she wants.

88
05:49.747 --> 05:52.560
How could I possibly fight back?

89
05:56.411 --> 05:57.412
Don't worry.

90
05:58.440 --> 05:59.441
This little ant

91
06:00.358 --> 06:01.659
will bring that elephant down.

92
07:20.384 --> 07:21.560
No, Ta. You've got it all wrong.

93
07:21.630 --> 07:24.235
I had this ring custom-made for you.

94
07:24.976 --> 07:26.288
It definitely isn't Nopnapha's.

95
07:27.678 --> 07:29.920
Ta... Calm down. I'm on my way.

96
07:31.366 --> 07:32.367
Director, sir.

97
07:32.969 --> 07:35.480
The Director-General has asked me to invite you to discuss next year's policies.

98
07:38.200 --> 07:40.280
This is the asset declaration

99
07:40.494 --> 07:43.200
Nopnapha submitted before taking office.

100
07:44.259 --> 07:46.260
It clearly lists the details of the ring.

101
07:47.470 --> 07:48.760
And this is the diamond certificate.

102
07:50.638 --> 07:51.639
What about yours?

103
07:57.627 --> 07:59.300
When someone gives you a gift,

104
07:59.712 --> 08:01.648
they don't usually include the receipt, you know.

105
08:02.480 --> 08:05.360
All I got was the ring. I didn't even get the box.

106
08:06.008 --> 08:08.250
Because he slipped it right onto my finger.

107
08:09.600 --> 08:10.601
I mean,

108
08:11.624 --> 08:12.960
Director Jenphop did.

109
08:13.867 --> 08:17.200
Are you saying that Ms.Nopnapha's husband

110
08:18.182 --> 08:19.600
stole this ring and gave it to you?

111
08:20.358 --> 08:21.359
No.

112
08:21.584 --> 08:24.640
He just had an identical ring made for me.

113
08:25.814 --> 08:28.240
So where is Director Jenphop?

114
08:28.960 --> 08:30.080
Is he coming or not?

115
08:46.998 --> 08:48.000
You can't do that, Uncle.

116
08:48.438 --> 08:50.640
If you don't show up, who's going to testify for Ta?

117
08:51.078 --> 08:52.650
Besides, you're the one who caused all this.

118
08:53.220 --> 08:55.600
Sending someone else isn't the same as coming yourself.

119
08:59.307 --> 09:00.920
Hold on, Uncle. Tetris is calling.

120
09:04.272 --> 09:05.273
Hello, Tetris.

121
09:05.302 --> 09:08.280
Where are you, Veekit? Why are you taking so long today?

122
09:08.651 --> 09:10.790
Sorry, Tetris. Something came up.

123
09:11.632 --> 09:14.000
Can you get a ride home by yourself?

124
09:14.430 --> 09:15.731
And take good care of your sister.

125
09:16.110 --> 09:17.520
Oh, okay.

126
09:19.064 --> 09:20.165
Veekit said we can go home on our own.

127
09:20.440 --> 09:22.120
- Yay! - Hey!

128
09:22.936 --> 09:24.880
He said go home, not go partying!

129
09:25.446 --> 09:27.440
I'm taking the bus home. Let go!

130
09:27.622 --> 09:29.960
No way. I'm just booking a ride.

131
09:30.288 --> 09:32.864
Then go ahead. I can take the bus by myself.

132
09:34.734 --> 09:35.735
Hey!

133
09:36.334 --> 09:37.640
Wait for me, you bitch!

134
09:38.878 --> 09:42.000
So, is the man who gave you the ring coming or not?

135
09:48.742 --> 09:50.091
Director Jenphop has an urgent matter to attend to.

136
09:53.019 --> 09:55.240
So he sent a gemologist in his place.

137
10:06.443 --> 10:10.640
According to the certificate, Ms. Nopnapha's diamond is graded VVS1.

138
10:10.854 --> 10:12.822
That means it has very slight internal inclusions.

139
10:13.088 --> 10:15.089
As for Mutta's ring,

140
10:15.406 --> 10:16.800
the diamond is graded Flawless.

141
10:16.851 --> 10:19.091
That means it has no internal or external flaws.

142
10:19.539 --> 10:21.480
We can confirm they're different diamonds

143
10:21.500 --> 10:24.401
because their laser-inscribed identification numbers don't match.

144
10:24.707 --> 10:28.000
So they're two different rings with different diamond grades.

145
10:33.971 --> 10:36.520
Sir, the police have released Mutta.

146
10:37.340 --> 10:38.341
Yes, ma'am.

147
10:45.016 --> 10:47.240
Where's the Director-General?

148
10:47.920 --> 10:49.238
I've been waiting for an hour!

149
10:50.278 --> 10:51.760
He's asked to postpone the meeting to another day.

150
10:52.310 --> 10:54.520
- What? - He also asked me to apologize on his behalf.

151
10:55.201 --> 10:56.480
What the hell?

152
11:03.320 --> 11:04.440
What's his problem?

153
11:08.251 --> 11:10.500
Ta... How did it go?

154
11:12.859 --> 11:15.078
Everything's settled. It's all over now.

155
11:15.659 --> 11:17.060
Thanks for not showing up,

156
11:18.014 --> 11:19.475
but at least going to the trouble of sending someone in your place.

157
11:20.286 --> 11:21.720
Ta, I'm really sorry.

158
11:22.286 --> 11:24.720
I'm done with my business now. Where are you, Ta?

159
11:25.102 --> 11:26.160
I'll come see you right away.

160
11:26.616 --> 11:29.440
It's okay. I'm with Veekit. Bye.

161
11:30.734 --> 11:32.640
Ma'am, she's out now.

162
11:35.011 --> 11:35.712
Ta.

163
11:35.715 --> 11:39.160
That lying bitch has such a slap-worthy face, ma'am!

164
11:42.414 --> 11:43.880
You've heard about it, haven't you?

165
11:44.312 --> 11:46.560
That our diamonds are of different grades.

166
11:46.990 --> 11:48.360
Now you know

167
11:48.651 --> 11:51.880
which woman your husband loves more.

168
11:55.622 --> 11:57.430
Ma'am, are you okay?

169
11:57.440 --> 11:59.840
Who pissed you off, ma'am? Hello?

170
11:59.900 --> 12:01.883
What made you decide to wear that ring today?

171
12:01.963 --> 12:03.240
I told you not to wear it, didn't I?

172
12:03.707 --> 12:05.880
I only wear it when I'm with you, Director.

173
12:07.110 --> 12:08.440
It would be such a shame

174
12:08.827 --> 12:10.880
to keep something this beautiful locked away in a box.

175
12:15.910 --> 12:17.200
Let me tell you a little secret.

176
12:17.714 --> 12:18.715
This ring,

177
12:19.755 --> 12:21.720
even though it looks just like Nopnapha's,

178
12:23.216 --> 12:25.920
has a diamond of much higher quality.

179
12:34.667 --> 12:36.107
Oshi, please go check on Aunt Nopnapha.

180
12:37.046 --> 12:38.528
And get her some medicine for her sore throat, too.

181
12:50.843 --> 12:53.174
Thanks. Sorry for wasting your time.

182
12:55.979 --> 12:57.899
It's okay. I wasn't busy anyway.

183
13:01.700 --> 13:03.504
But could you please stop wearing that ring?

184
13:07.534 --> 13:09.235
I hardly ever see you wearing it anyway.

185
13:10.091 --> 13:11.700
Every time you do, it causes trouble.

186
13:12.331 --> 13:13.800
I'm not the one causing trouble.

187
13:14.070 --> 13:16.071
You should be blaming your aunt instead.

188
13:17.094 --> 13:19.280
If I confront Aunt Nopnapha, she'll just turn around and blame you.

189
13:19.632 --> 13:21.500
She'll say you went after her husband first, Ta.

190
13:23.472 --> 13:25.773
Seriously, do you think there's any chance

191
13:26.320 --> 13:27.628
you'll stop seeing Uncle Phop?

192
13:31.254 --> 13:32.255
Of course there is.

193
13:33.174 --> 13:34.440
Just not anytime soon.

194
13:35.552 --> 13:38.760
Then when, Ta? What are you waiting for?

195
13:41.070 --> 13:42.071
I've got to go.

196
13:42.680 --> 13:43.681
Ta.

197
13:45.155 --> 13:47.859
Wanna grab some dim sum in Thonglor? My treat.

198
13:49.016 --> 13:51.240
Your treat? What's the occasion?

199
13:54.016 --> 13:55.480
To cheer you up after getting arrested.

200
13:59.494 --> 14:01.480
Nah, I don't like dim sum.

201
14:02.650 --> 14:04.890
If you don't want to go, at least come up with a better excuse.

202
14:07.350 --> 14:08.960
You've been to that restaurant with Uncle Phop plenty of times.

203
14:09.318 --> 14:12.280
I know because I made the reservations myself.

204
14:13.414 --> 14:14.920
Uncle Phop told me you loved that place.

205
14:15.579 --> 14:17.720
I used to, but I don't anymore.

206
14:18.059 --> 14:19.400
People can change, can't they?

207
14:21.078 --> 14:22.600
Is that really the reason?

208
14:32.120 --> 14:34.536
You look different. Did you get a haircut?

209
14:36.286 --> 14:37.920
Do I look pretty? Do you like it?

210
14:38.467 --> 14:39.468
You look cute.

211
14:42.192 --> 14:44.680
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

212
14:44.872 --> 14:47.131
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

213
14:47.424 --> 14:49.920
♪ Happy birthday, my love ♪

214
14:50.048 --> 14:52.480
♪ Happy birthday to you ♪

215
14:52.907 --> 14:54.608
Yay! Make a wish!

216
15:04.131 --> 15:05.760
I don't see my prayer has been answered.

217
15:06.478 --> 15:07.760
What did you wish for?

218
15:08.563 --> 15:11.080
I wished you'd leave Thailand

219
15:12.659 --> 15:14.680
and come live here with me. Right now.

220
15:15.060 --> 15:16.661
Oh, come on. Don't be so dramatic.

221
15:16.851 --> 15:19.160
I'll come back as soon as I've taken care of everything.

222
15:19.806 --> 15:21.000
Is your sister's business

223
15:22.054 --> 15:24.240
so important that you have to abandon your work and me?

224
15:26.502 --> 15:29.830
Andrew, she's my only sister.

225
15:30.427 --> 15:31.840
And I'm not leaving you.

226
15:32.720 --> 15:35.200
Yeah, I understand that just

227
15:36.774 --> 15:38.240
I need time to accept it, you know?

228
15:39.494 --> 15:40.800
I will waiting for you, Nina.

229
15:41.515 --> 15:42.816
I'm waiting for that, too.

230
15:46.263 --> 15:48.500
Nina, what's that ring?

231
15:51.987 --> 15:54.560
It's just a toy ring. I bought it for fun.

232
16:01.952 --> 16:03.320
You've got quite the connections, haven't you?

233
16:04.700 --> 16:05.701
Huh?

234
16:06.014 --> 16:07.518
Last time, it was a hospital director.

235
16:07.886 --> 16:09.107
This time, it's a police inspector.

236
16:09.720 --> 16:11.800
Who's next? The Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces?

237
16:12.552 --> 16:14.678
How could you bully her like that?

238
16:14.918 --> 16:16.976
Ta is just a defenseless young woman, Nopnapha!

239
16:23.483 --> 16:24.484
What?

240
16:36.048 --> 16:38.678
Hey, Nopnapha! Have you lost your mind?

241
16:40.960 --> 16:43.200
Hey! Don't you dare! Don't!

242
16:43.211 --> 16:44.212
Goddamn it!

243
16:46.595 --> 16:48.158
Hey, what's that noise?

244
16:57.390 --> 16:58.760
You think you're the only one who can go crazy?

245
16:59.283 --> 17:00.560
I can go crazy, too, damn it!

246
17:03.363 --> 17:05.440
How do you like that? Huh?

247
17:06.768 --> 17:08.440
So now you're swearing at me, huh?

248
17:08.838 --> 17:09.839
Damn right!

249
17:12.139 --> 17:13.480
What are you gonna do about it?

250
17:16.294 --> 17:18.832
- Mom! Hurry and stop them! - Let's go!

251
17:19.030 --> 17:22.080
Having an identical copy of the ring you gave me made for that bitch was insulting enough!

252
17:22.102 --> 17:23.640
And her diamond is even more expensive than mine!

253
17:24.886 --> 17:27.200
Oh, so that's what this is about. You're just being greedy!

254
17:27.286 --> 17:28.640
This isn't about the money, damn it!

255
17:28.918 --> 17:31.320
It's about you valuing that damn mistress

256
17:31.340 --> 17:32.710
more than my dignity as your lawful wife!

257
17:32.720 --> 17:35.621
Haven't you figured it out yet? I love Ta!

258
17:35.641 --> 17:37.642
Of course I want to give her the very best!

259
17:37.699 --> 17:39.800
As for all that nonsense about your dignity and pride,

260
17:39.843 --> 17:41.644
that's just something you've made up in your head!

261
17:41.704 --> 17:42.718
You're driving yourself crazy over nothing!

262
17:42.808 --> 17:45.040
Crazy, huh? You bastard, Jenphop! Take this!

263
17:45.700 --> 17:47.000
Ouch! That hurts, damn it!

264
17:47.166 --> 17:49.120
Hey! I just had a hair transplant, damn it!

265
17:49.167 --> 17:50.368
Like I give a damn!

266
17:50.494 --> 17:52.960
Ouch! That fucking hurts, you know!

267
17:53.422 --> 17:54.440
My hair's all messed up!

268
17:54.974 --> 17:57.040
I love Ta! Didn't you hear me?

269
17:57.550 --> 17:58.920
You're supposed to love me!

270
17:59.659 --> 18:02.520
- Uncle! Uncle! - Stop scratching me!

271
18:02.566 --> 18:04.680
That's enough! Both of you, stop!

272
18:05.963 --> 18:07.640
- Are you okay? - Clean up this house right now!

273
18:08.574 --> 18:11.270
A TV crew is coming to film tomorrow. Have you forgotten?

274
18:11.275 --> 18:12.766
Oh, that's perfect.

275
18:12.931 --> 18:15.320
Tomorrow, I'll take them on a tour of our bedrooms.

276
18:15.470 --> 18:17.071
I'll let the whole country know

277
18:17.525 --> 18:19.326
that this so-called model family

278
18:19.384 --> 18:21.120
has a husband and wife who sleep in separate rooms.

279
18:22.606 --> 18:24.160
You think you'd actually dare say that?

280
18:24.180 --> 18:25.940
- You're all talk! - Wanna bet?

281
18:25.960 --> 18:27.520
Go ahead, pick whichever show you want!

282
18:27.568 --> 18:30.480
How about Rueang Yai Rai Wan? Or Jud? What about Jud?

283
18:30.582 --> 18:32.250
Jud, the one who digs out every truth!

284
18:32.283 --> 18:33.284
Phop.

285
18:34.491 --> 18:36.752
Family isn't something to joke about.

286
18:37.092 --> 18:39.087
Think about your children, too.

287
18:39.560 --> 18:41.400
Don't let a moment of anger

288
18:41.550 --> 18:43.518
destroy our family, Phop.

289
18:43.651 --> 18:45.280
Oh, come on. There's nothing left to destroy!

290
18:45.400 --> 18:47.560
The kids already know exactly what their parents are like.

291
18:47.942 --> 18:50.440
Two rotten peas in a pod aren't going to split up that easily.

292
18:50.600 --> 18:53.240
So we'll just have to keep living like this!

293
18:53.915 --> 18:57.360
Besides, if we divorced, who would get you promoted, huh?

294
18:57.728 --> 18:59.480
That's right! If we got divorced,

295
18:59.760 --> 19:03.480
your three-time Perfect Woman of the Year award

296
19:03.542 --> 19:04.560
would be taken away!

297
19:05.366 --> 19:08.216
Your ego is bigger than Mount Everest!

298
19:08.510 --> 19:10.130
And your skin is thinner than a sheet of paper!

299
19:10.350 --> 19:12.080
No matter how much of a bastard I am,

300
19:12.238 --> 19:15.300
you'll never divorce me!

301
19:15.752 --> 19:17.840
Jenphop, get over here!

302
19:18.053 --> 19:20.395
