38:55.014 --> 38:56.600
Do you really think you can change?

599
38:57.766 --> 39:00.064
Change what? What have I done wrong?

600
39:02.291 --> 39:04.179
You betrayed our marriage.

601
39:04.403 --> 39:05.928
You betrayed our family.

602
39:06.456 --> 39:08.227
Are you seriously blaming me for this?

603
39:08.963 --> 39:10.500
Your logic is completely twisted!

604
39:12.158 --> 39:14.366
Phop, you have to trust me.

605
39:14.494 --> 39:16.232
I'll take you to see a psychiatrist myself.

606
39:18.296 --> 39:19.560
See? This is exactly why!

607
39:26.502 --> 39:27.503
Phop!

608
39:28.198 --> 39:30.000
Every time we talk, it ends up like this!

609
39:30.747 --> 39:32.500
Where are you going? Come back here right now!

610
39:33.264 --> 39:34.265
Phop!

611
39:39.100 --> 39:40.101
Ta.

612
39:40.741 --> 39:41.980
- Ta! - Director.

613
39:42.165 --> 39:44.920
What happened? Why did you suddenly leave the room?

614
39:46.979 --> 39:48.616
I went to get some toys from my car.

615
39:49.080 --> 39:52.595
But I ran into Nopnapha, so I had to hide.

616
39:53.224 --> 39:54.376
How are you, Director?

617
39:54.696 --> 39:56.600
She didn't get violent with you, did she?

618
39:58.392 --> 40:01.848
Nopnapha wouldn't dare! I slapped her to teach her a lesson.

619
40:02.093 --> 40:03.680
I told her never to interfere with me again.

620
40:07.680 --> 40:10.352
Then what's that mark on your neck?

621
40:14.800 --> 40:17.801
Do you really think a hickey on his neck will get under Mutta's skin?

622
40:19.000 --> 40:21.520
Of course! At least a little.

623
40:22.670 --> 40:24.250
I thought you said you didn't have feelings for her anymore.

624
40:24.877 --> 40:27.200
Then what's that? It's clearly a hickey!

625
40:28.080 --> 40:29.081
Well, Ta, it's...

626
40:30.971 --> 40:32.560
I didn't do anything, Ta.

627
40:33.067 --> 40:34.176
I was just lying there.

628
40:34.550 --> 40:36.800
Nopnapha did everything herself.

629
40:37.551 --> 40:38.552
Did you finish?

630
40:38.900 --> 40:39.901
Yes.

631
40:40.032 --> 40:41.560
Oh, fabulous!

632
40:41.942 --> 40:45.632
That'll drive her even crazier, like a cockroach drenched in piss!

633
40:47.629 --> 40:50.328
But do you think that'll be enough to make Mutta leave Phop?

634
40:51.900 --> 40:55.600
If Mutta's only angry with Jenphop,

635
40:56.648 --> 40:58.249
that might not be enough.

636
41:02.440 --> 41:04.355
I've given you my whole heart, Director.

637
41:04.931 --> 41:07.532
And I expect you to give me yours, and yours alone.

638
41:08.400 --> 41:10.900
But you gave in so easily and let her have her way with you.

639
41:11.976 --> 41:15.171
Now I'm starting to wonder why you still won't divorce her.

640
41:16.083 --> 41:17.284
Could it be that you still love her?

641
41:17.304 --> 41:19.200
Oh, come on, Ta. Why won't you believe me?

642
41:20.000 --> 41:23.755
It was just a physical reaction to being stimulated.

643
41:24.763 --> 41:25.764
So I just...

644
41:27.168 --> 41:29.200
responded naturally. That's all.

645
41:30.800 --> 41:31.801
Ta.

646
41:32.232 --> 41:35.939
But you're the only one in my heart.

647
41:48.100 --> 41:49.101
Hey!

648
41:50.400 --> 41:51.401
Ta!

649
41:53.835 --> 41:54.836
What's this?

650
41:57.142 --> 41:58.920
I thought you said I was the only man in your life!

651
41:59.304 --> 42:00.640
Then who the hell is this foreign guy?

652
42:21.000 --> 42:22.001
Thank you.

653
42:24.296 --> 42:26.059
If you hadn't sent me that video,

654
42:26.963 --> 42:29.040
I'd never have known what Ta was really like.

655
42:31.827 --> 42:34.232
Better late than never.

656
42:38.606 --> 42:40.638
A woman who has an affair with a married man

657
42:42.403 --> 42:43.923
can't be faithful to anyone.

658
42:56.571 --> 42:58.080
I'll have the housekeeper

659
42:58.539 --> 43:01.046
move your things back into our bedroom.

660
43:06.246 --> 43:07.856
Ta is taking a course

661
43:09.342 --> 43:11.264
to practice her English with a foreign teacher.

662
43:13.294 --> 43:15.500
Because she wants to improve herself

663
43:16.120 --> 43:19.040
so she can be worthy of being my wife.

664
43:22.149 --> 43:24.256
See? Now do you understand

665
43:25.339 --> 43:27.483
just how much that woman loves me?

666
43:28.464 --> 43:30.600
You've never shown me that kind of love.

667
43:36.400 --> 43:37.955
With the way you behave,

668
43:38.792 --> 43:41.760
- how can you expect me to love you? - That's exactly why, damn it!

669
43:43.262 --> 43:44.680
I stopped loving you

670
43:45.352 --> 43:47.553
because of the way you behave, too!

671
43:49.582 --> 43:51.384
Go ahead, slather on more of that cream!

672
43:51.960 --> 43:53.550
Better yet, shove it down your throat!

673
43:54.312 --> 43:57.230
Maybe then you'll learn to speak more gently to your husband!

674
44:51.032 --> 44:52.680
- It's Dad, sweetheart. - Yes?

675
44:55.710 --> 44:56.711
What are you doing?

676
44:57.571 --> 44:58.640
Reading.

677
44:59.128 --> 45:01.280
Are you done fighting with Mom?

678
45:03.766 --> 45:04.767
Yeah.

679
45:06.678 --> 45:09.000
I came to ask you to go keep your mom company.

680
45:09.770 --> 45:10.771
It's always the same.

681
45:11.371 --> 45:13.419
You hurt Mom, then expect me to go comfort her.

682
45:14.283 --> 45:15.872
If you'd just break up with that damn mistress of yours,

683
45:16.535 --> 45:18.438
you wouldn't have to keep fighting with Mom every single day.

684
45:19.248 --> 45:20.614
I'm sick and tired of hearing you fight, too.

685
45:21.249 --> 45:23.795
Tetris, listen to me.

686
45:24.728 --> 45:27.662
The only reason I'm still with your mom is because I love you.

687
45:29.331 --> 45:30.766
But I don't love your mom anymore.

688
45:31.957 --> 45:35.800
Besides, I'm a man, so...

689
45:36.900 --> 45:38.651
It's only natural for men to have those needs.

690
45:39.440 --> 45:40.641
You understand, don't you, Tetris?

691
45:41.920 --> 45:42.921
No.

692
45:44.000 --> 45:45.832
I'll never understand macho men like you, Dad.

693
45:46.398 --> 45:47.440
I'm a ladyboy.

694
46:03.043 --> 46:06.680
They're natural fighters and use their stingers to attack their enemies.

695
46:06.728 --> 46:08.798
Their stings cause intense pain and a burning sensation.

696
46:09.091 --> 46:11.920
If someone gets stung repeatedly or is allergic to their venom,

697
46:12.056 --> 46:13.440
they could even go into shock.

698
46:13.848 --> 46:16.880
Small but fierce. That's why I love fire ants.

699
46:17.283 --> 46:18.284
Thank you.

700
46:21.288 --> 46:24.480
Excellent! If I were your teacher, I'd give you...

701
46:25.928 --> 46:27.300
a perfect ten!

702
46:27.400 --> 46:29.601
- Thank you. - Keep it just like that, okay?

703
46:29.774 --> 46:31.175
Sure! I feel much more confident now.

704
46:31.427 --> 46:33.880
Hey, what are you two up to?

705
46:34.352 --> 46:37.000
I have a class presentation tomorrow, so I'm practicing in front of Veekit.

706
46:39.062 --> 46:41.712
Oh, perfect! Go practice in front of your mom.

707
46:42.063 --> 46:44.680
Tetris is upstairs with her. They can both give you feedback.

708
46:44.960 --> 46:45.961
Okay!

709
46:50.251 --> 46:51.942
You're actually pretty good to Aunt Nopnapha, Uncle Phop.

710
46:53.566 --> 46:56.840
You just had a huge fight, and now you're sending the kids to comfort her.

711
46:57.635 --> 46:59.726
Hey, of course!

712
47:01.022 --> 47:04.280
What if she gets so upset she has a stroke and dies? Who'd sign off on my promotion?

713
47:05.438 --> 47:07.600
Seriously, Uncle? Is that all you care about?

714
47:08.910 --> 47:10.851
Don't you ever think about the times you two were in love?

715
47:14.776 --> 47:18.440
Wait until you're married and you're my age.

716
47:18.883 --> 47:20.384
Then you'll understand, Veekit.

717
47:33.500 --> 47:37.960
Hey, everyone! The higher-ups want to cut costs for this year's New Year's party.

718
47:38.300 --> 47:40.563
So there won't be any live performances by professional artists like in previous years.

719
47:40.683 --> 47:41.684
- What? - What?

720
47:41.694 --> 47:45.050
So what are we supposed to do? Just sit around eating and crunching on crackers?

721
47:45.422 --> 47:46.800
Wouldn't that be boring, Toey?

722
47:46.850 --> 47:48.638
Hey, but I've already made a suggestion.

723
47:49.192 --> 47:51.123
They said each department

724
47:51.272 --> 47:54.800
should put on one performance, and the higher-ups agreed.

725
47:55.390 --> 47:57.960
But that means our division has to put on a show, too.

726
47:58.947 --> 48:00.160
I'll do it!

727
48:01.774 --> 48:04.918
♪ A junior high dancer, a daughter of poor farmers ♪

728
48:05.062 --> 48:08.160
♪ Please, you in the front row, keep your eyes in check ♪

729
48:08.374 --> 48:11.440
♪ If your eyes won't behave, at least keep your hands to yourself ♪

730
48:11.574 --> 48:14.760
♪ Or this schoolgirl will lose points from her teacher ♪

731
48:14.800 --> 48:17.840
♪ Or this schoolgirl will lose points from her teacher ♪

732
48:24.195 --> 48:29.196
♪ This is a journey into danger ♪

733
48:29.406 --> 48:33.000
♪ Into a terrible catastrophe ♪

734
48:36.640 --> 48:41.041
♪ How am I supposed to go on living? ♪

735
48:44.232 --> 48:48.520
♪ Who am I living ♪

736
48:48.920 --> 48:50.720
♪ this life for? ♪

737
48:51.870 --> 48:53.071
Give him a round of applause!

738
48:53.763 --> 48:54.840
Come on, clap!

739
48:55.886 --> 48:59.044
♪ Coming home late, deep down a deserted alley ♪

740
48:59.134 --> 49:02.400
♪ All alone, with no one else around ♪

741
49:02.835 --> 49:05.120
♪ As I walk in, my heart nearly stops ♪

742
49:05.500 --> 49:09.301
♪ If I keep worrying like this, I'll be in trouble ♪

743
49:10.501 --> 49:12.302
Enough, enough!

744
49:12.802 --> 49:14.803
Sit down, everyone.

745
49:17.088 --> 49:19.489
Whiskey, your vocal runs were amazing!

746
49:19.520 --> 49:21.552
You could be a professional singer!

747
49:22.021 --> 49:23.040
Thank you.

748
49:23.515 --> 49:26.050
Cha-am, you've got a really powerful voice.

749
49:26.232 --> 49:28.080
But your style might be a little too hard for people to appreciate.

750
49:29.011 --> 49:31.646
As for you, Phorn, you still need a lot of practice.

751
49:32.931 --> 49:34.947
All right, then.

752
49:35.240 --> 49:37.880
- I'll go with Phorn. - Huh?

753
49:39.038 --> 49:41.680
But let's make it a luk thung song. Something fun and upbeat.

754
49:41.758 --> 49:43.960
- Thank you, Toey! Of course! - Why did you pick Phorn?

755
49:44.120 --> 49:45.440
Didn't you just say Whiskey was a great singer?

756
49:45.954 --> 49:48.072
Listen, Ta. You've been working here for quite a while now.

757
49:48.285 --> 49:51.040
Haven't you learned to respect seniority yet?

758
49:53.918 --> 49:55.619
And as for the lead dancer,

759
49:57.134 --> 49:58.135
that's me.

760
49:59.736 --> 50:03.440
From now on, everyone must call me Master Sak!

761
50:11.608 --> 50:14.130
That's enough, Auntie. Save it for the actual performance.

762
50:15.166 --> 50:17.680
All right, come on! A thousand baht each!

763
50:17.700 --> 50:18.701
What's that for?

764
50:18.920 --> 50:21.800
- Your funeral expenses, maybe? - Meow!

765
50:21.900 --> 50:24.681
Just kidding! It's for the costumes. Come on.

766
50:25.134 --> 50:27.600
Hurry up and pay now, or you'll forget later.

767
50:28.286 --> 50:29.360
Here. Keep the change.

768
50:31.899 --> 50:35.640
Hey, Mutta! Didn't you bring any money? Hand over a thousand baht.

769
50:36.976 --> 50:39.600
You're not even joining in? Where's your team spirit?

770
50:40.091 --> 50:42.320
Ta, do you want to borrow some money from me?

771
50:45.488 --> 50:48.840
It's supposed to be a group effort! Don't you have any team spirit?

772
50:53.248 --> 50:55.782
You should've joined the singing contest earlier, Ta.

773
50:56.587 --> 50:58.912
I'd love to see you as a singer.

774
50:59.611 --> 51:01.301
You don't even have to sing well.

775
51:01.387 --> 51:04.331
Your beauty alone would captivate everyone.

776
51:05.700 --> 51:06.701
Ta.

777
51:08.966 --> 51:12.080
Hey, everyone! What are you performing at the New Year's party?

778
51:12.268 --> 51:13.926
The Slaughter of the Old Hen.

779
51:13.969 --> 51:16.256
And we'll be doing a sacrificial dance alongside it.

780
51:17.083 --> 51:20.084
I'm not performing with them. I'd rather just watch.

781
51:20.792 --> 51:21.870
Then why don't you perform with me?

782
51:22.211 --> 51:24.867
I'm doing a magic show, and I need an assistant.

783
51:25.262 --> 51:29.880
So the assistant has to wear something revealing and hand you props, right?

784
51:30.051 --> 51:32.440
I've got just the figure for it, Veekit!

785
51:34.939 --> 51:37.067
Okay, I'll perform with you, Veekit.

786
52:01.190 --> 52:04.032
Jolene, watch my livestream during the performance.

787
52:04.379 --> 52:05.840
And when the big moment comes,

788
52:06.056 --> 52:07.920
quickly clip the video and take screenshots.

789
52:08.243 --> 52:10.480
Post them on every social media platform as fast as you can.

790
52:10.920 --> 52:13.840
This is going to be so much fun, Nopnapha will scream!

791
53:08.315 --> 53:09.316
Ten million baht.

792
53:10.640 --> 53:13.080
I hope that's enough to buy my husband back.

793
53:13.451 --> 53:16.760
The Director's skills in bed are worth far more than ten million.

794
53:17.600 --> 53:18.601
Keep your money.

795
53:19.560 --> 53:21.361
You might need it someday to pay a man to sleep with you.

796
53:22.454 --> 53:24.960
Someone go ask that damn mistress what happened to her.

797
53:25.254 --> 53:28.055
Everyone wants to know what happened to Ta, don't they?

798
53:28.097 --> 53:30.760
Why should I be the only one asking?

799
53:31.763 --> 53:33.560
Why do you have to pry into other people's business?

800
53:34.307 --> 53:36.000
Will knowing make your lives any better?

801
53:36.707 --> 53:37.920
But I know what happened.

802
53:39.448 --> 53:41.200
Come on, tell us a little!

803
53:45.176 --> 53:47.400
Call a hitman and have that bitch shot in the head right now!

804
53:47.400 --> 53:48.400
MkvDrama.net
